    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "eating the first meal of soft rice (himeii) after the traditional hard rice of New Year (kowaii)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "お正月の硬いお餅を食べ終え、ほっと一息ついて姫始めの準備をする。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "実家では、三が日を過ぎたら、必ず姫始めとして柔らかいご飯を炊く。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「お正月のごちそうも美味しかったけど、やっぱりこの柔らかいご飯が一番落ち着くね。姫始めだ！」と、家族で笑顔で語り合った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "first intercourse of the New Year",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "江戸時代の川柳には、夫婦の姫始めをユーモラスに詠んだものが少なくない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "新年の無病息災を願いつつ、夫婦水入らずで姫始めの夜を過ごした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "昔の風習について書かれた本に、姫始めという言葉の語源について解説があった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "loss of virginity",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "彼女は小説の中で、主人公の姫始めの出来事を繊細な筆致で描いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "遊郭の歴史を調べる中で、遊女の姫始めにまつわる儀式の記録を見つけた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その古い映画は、思春期の少女の姫始めと心の成長をテーマにしている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
